---
// Mint — YSWS landing page
const title = "Mint — an Altoids-tin hardware YSWS";
const description = "Ship a hardware project sized to an Altoids tin, journal the build, and get a $75 grant plus the tin itself.";
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,500;8..60,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="topbar">
    <a href="#" class="logo"><span class="dot"></span>MINT</a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#deal">The deal</a>
      <a href="#fits">What fits</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#submit" class="cta-small">Submit</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  <section class="hero" style="border-top:none;">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">A Hack Club YSWS · you ship, we ship</p>
      <h1>Build something that fits<br>in an <span class="accent">Altoids tin.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Mint is a hardware challenge for small spaces. Ship a project sized to a real Altoids tin, journal how you built it, and we'll send you the tin itself plus a $75 grant to fill it.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#submit" class="btn btn-primary">Start your project →</a>
        <a href="https://slack.com/archives/C0BK69GFA0Z" class="btn btn-ghost">Join #mint on Slack</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tin-stage">
      <div>
        <div class="tin-photo-frame">
          <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}altoids-tin.png`} alt="An open Altoids tin" />
        </div>
        <p class="spec-tag">Fits within <span>3.75" × 2.375" × 0.8"</span><br>the footprint of a real Altoids tin</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="deal">
    <p class="section-kicker">The exchange</p>
    <h2>You ship, we ship.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Straightforward trade: you build and document something that lives inside an Altoids tin, we cover the cost of making it happen.</p>
    <div class="deal-grid">
      <div class="deal-card">
        <h3>You provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>A hardware project that fits inside an Altoids tin</li>
          <li>A GitHub journal of the design process</li>
          <li>No timelapses needed — just real progress logs</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="swap-icon">⇄</div>
      <div class="deal-card">
        <h3>We provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>An Altoids tin to build inside</li>
          <li>A $75 grant on completion</li>
          <li>A spot in the #mint community</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="fits">
    <p class="section-kicker">Scope</p>
    <h2>If it's contained in the Altoids tin, it counts.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Beginner or advanced, simple or clever — here's the kind of thing past builders have shipped in similar formats. Use these as a starting point, not a limit.</p>
    <div class="fits-grid">
      <div class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="8" rx="1.5"/><path d="M6 9V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2M6 17v3M18 17v3"/><circle cx="9" cy="13" r="1.5"/><circle cx="13.5" cy="13" r="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="13" r="1.5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Micro synth</h4>
        <p>A pocket-sized noisemaker — oscillators, buttons, maybe a speaker crammed into the lid.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><rect x="7" y="6" width="10" height="7" rx="1"/><circle cx="9" cy="17" r="1.2"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1.2"/><circle cx="15" cy="17" r="1.2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Pocket game</h4>
        <p>A tiny screen and a couple of buttons is all it takes for a game you can carry anywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M7 10v4M11 10v4M15 10h3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Hacking tool</h4>
        <p>Flipper Zero-esque gadget for signal sniffing, badge cloning, or general mischief.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.9 4.9l2.8 2.8M16.3 16.3l2.8 2.8M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.9 19.1l2.8-2.8M16.3 7.7l2.8-2.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Meshtastic node</h4>
        <p>A tin-sized off-grid radio node, because mesh networks deserve tiny enclosures too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="how">
    <p class="section-kicker">Process</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <h4>Get the spec</h4>
        <p>Your build envelope is fixed: 3.75" × 2.375" × 0.8". Everything else is up to you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <h4>Design + build</h4>
        <p>Sketch it, prototype it, solder it. Short and scrappy beats big and stalled.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <h4>Journal on GitHub</h4>
        <p>Log your process the way Rework, Highway, and Outpost builders do. No timelapses required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="num">04</span>
        <h4>Ship it</h4>
        <p>Submit when it's done. We send the $75 grant and your Altoids tin.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section>
    <div class="why">
      <blockquote>Mint is a "fresh" challenge in hardware — a short break from the big projects everyone's been slaving away on.</blockquote>
      <div class="why-copy">
        <p>Most people building lately have gravitated toward big, extravagant projects. Those can wear on you mentally.</p>
        <p>Mint is a lower-stakes, lower-hour-count alternative — something a beginner or an advanced builder can pick up, finish, and actually feel good about shipping.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="submit">
    <p class="section-kicker">Ready?</p>
    <h2>Submit your project</h2>
    <div class="submit-panel">
      <p>Fill out the form below once your project is built and journaled. Have questions first? Drop them in <a href="https://slack.com/archives/C0BK69GFA0Z" style="color:var(--mint);">#mint</a>.</p>
      <div class="form-embed">
        <iframe
          src="https://form.fillout.com/t/your-fillout-form-id"
          title="Mint submission form"
          loading="lazy"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="form-note">↑ replace the Fillout form URL with your live form before publishing</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    Mint · a Hack Club YSWS · <a href="https://slack.com/archives/C0BK69GFA0Z">#mint on Slack</a>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>

<style>

  :root{
    --bg:#142019;
    --bg-alt:#1c2d23;
    --paper:#f4efe2;
    --paper-dim:#e8e0cd;
    --mint:#8fead0;
    --mint-dim:#4f8a76;
    --tin-red:#d6301f;
    --tin-red-dim:#a3230f;
    --silver:#b9c2bc;
    --ink:#12190f;
    --ink-soft:#3c463a;
    --display: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    --body: 'Source Serif 4', serif;
    --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--paper);
    font-family:var(--body);
    line-height:1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
    *{animation-duration:0.001ms !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important;}
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px;}

  /* ---- top bar ---- */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(20,32,25,0.9);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(185,194,182,0.15);
  }
  .topbar{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:16px 24px;
  }
  .logo{
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.08em;
    font-size:20px; text-decoration:none; color:var(--paper);
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  }
  .logo .dot{width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--mint); display:inline-block;}
  .topbar nav a{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:13px; text-decoration:none;
    color:var(--silver); margin-left:24px; letter-spacing:0.03em;
  }
  .topbar nav a:hover{color:var(--mint);}
  .topbar .cta-small{
    background:var(--tin-red); color:var(--paper); padding:8px 16px;
    border-radius:20px; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:13px;
  }

  /* ---- hero ---- */
  .hero{
    padding:72px 0 56px;
    display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:48px; align-items:center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px){ .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr; padding-top:40px;} }

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--mint); margin:0 0 14px;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:700; font-size:clamp(38px,5.2vw,64px);
    line-height:1.02; margin:0 0 20px; letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  h1 .accent{color:var(--tin-red);}
  .lede{
    font-size:18px; color:var(--silver); max-width:46ch; margin:0 0 28px;
  }
  .hero-ctas{display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.02em;
    padding:14px 24px; border-radius:28px; text-decoration:none;
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--tin-red); color:var(--paper);}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:#e8402c;}
  .btn-ghost{border-color:rgba(185,194,182,0.4); color:var(--paper);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--mint); color:var(--mint);}

  /* ---- tin photo ---- */
  .tin-stage{display:flex; justify-content:center;}
  .tin-photo-frame{
    position:relative; width:100%; max-width:340px;
    transform:rotate(-3deg);
  }
  .tin-photo-frame img{
    display:block; width:100%; height:auto;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 24px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));
  }
  .spec-tag{
    margin-top:18px; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; color:var(--silver);
    text-align:center;
  }
  .spec-tag span{color:var(--mint);}

  /* ---- section shell ---- */
  section{padding:64px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(185,194,182,0.12);}
  h2{
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:600; font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);
    margin:0 0 8px; letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .section-kicker{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--mint-dim); margin:0 0 10px;
  }
  .section-intro{color:var(--silver); max-width:60ch; margin:0 0 36px; font-size:16px;}

  /* ---- the deal ---- */
  .deal-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr; gap:24px; align-items:stretch;}
  @media (max-width:720px){ .deal-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .deal-grid .swap-icon{display:none;} }
  .deal-card{
    background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); border-radius:22px; padding:28px;
  }
  .deal-card h3{
    font-family:var(--display); font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase;
    margin:0 0 16px; color:var(--tin-red-dim);
  }
  .deal-card ul{margin:0; padding-left:0; list-style:none;}
  .deal-card li{
    display:flex; gap:10px; padding:8px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(18,25,15,0.1); font-size:15px;
  }
  .deal-card li:first-child{border-top:none;}
  .deal-card li::before{content:"—"; color:var(--tin-red); flex-shrink:0;}
  .swap-icon{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:22px; color:var(--mint);
  }

  /* ---- what fits grid ---- */
  .fits-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px,1fr)); gap:18px;
  }
  .fit-card{
    background:var(--bg-alt); border:1px solid rgba(185,194,182,0.15); border-radius:20px;
    padding:22px; transition:border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .fit-card:hover{border-color:var(--mint);}
  .fit-card .icon{color:var(--mint); margin-bottom:12px;}
  .fit-card h4{
    font-family:var(--display); font-size:17px; margin:0 0 6px; font-weight:600;
  }
  .fit-card p{font-size:14px; color:var(--silver); margin:0;}

  /* ---- how it works ---- */
  .steps{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:20px;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;} }
  @media (max-width:520px){ .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .step{padding-top:16px; border-top:2px solid var(--mint-dim);}
  .step .num{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; color:var(--mint); display:block; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .step h4{font-family:var(--display); font-size:16px; margin:0 0 6px;}
  .step p{font-size:14px; color:var(--silver); margin:0;}

  /* ---- why ---- */
  .why{
    background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); border-radius:28px; padding:40px;
    display:grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap:32px; align-items:center;
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .why{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .why blockquote{
    margin:0; font-family:var(--body); font-style:italic; font-size:20px; line-height:1.5;
    color:var(--ink-soft); border-left:3px solid var(--tin-red); padding-left:20px;
  }
  .why .why-copy p{font-size:15px; margin:0 0 12px;}

  /* ---- submit ---- */
  .submit-panel{
    background:var(--bg-alt); border:1px solid rgba(185,194,182,0.18); border-radius:28px;
    padding:32px; text-align:center;
  }
  .submit-panel p{color:var(--silver); max-width:52ch; margin:0 auto 24px;}
  .form-embed{
    background:var(--paper); border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; margin-top:8px;
    min-height:420px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .form-embed iframe{width:100%; height:520px; border:none;}
  .form-note{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; color:var(--mint-dim); margin-top:14px;
  }

  footer{
    padding:36px 0 48px; text-align:center; color:var(--silver); font-size:13px;
    font-family:var(--mono);
  }
  footer a{color:var(--mint); text-decoration:none;}
  footer a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}

</style>
